# TMDB credentials. Either a v4 "API Read Access Token" (starts with eyJ...) or a v3 API key.
# Get one free at https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# If left empty, the app asks for a key on first launch and stores it in this browser only.
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides (used by `npm run dev:mock` for offline development)
# VITE_TMDB_API_BASE=https://api.themoviedb.org/3
# VITE_TMDB_IMAGE_BASE=https://image.tmdb.org/t/p
